Package: sedir-install
Version: 0.3.4
Architecture: @SEDIR_ARCH@
Maintainer: The SedirOS Authors <ahmetatakan.tech@gmail.com>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: libc6, util-linux, fdisk, dosfstools, e2fsprogs, cryptsetup, cryptsetup-initramfs, tar, udev
Description: SedirOS installer
 Installs SedirOS from the live ISO to a disk: GPT with an EFI system
 partition, an unencrypted /boot and a LUKS2-encrypted root, GRUB for UEFI.
 Run: sudo sedir-install disks; sudo sedir-install install --disk <disk>
 .
 Removed from the installed system by the installer itself.
